<h2 id="sources">Sources and notes</h2>
<p>The professional chronology, 2015 entry to Tsinghua, current PhD year, and Princeton visit use biography details I supplied and confirmed on 10 October 2026. Work experience is self-reported, not inferred from GitHub; this account takes precedence over older dates. My <a href="https://github.com/houx15/houx15.github.io/blob/40acdb33c13f878907e88f86319442715c398b3d/about/index.html">earlier public profile</a> records the Tsinghua degrees and September 2024 entry to Peking University’s Center for Social Research.</p>
<p><a href="/research/">Research</a> and <a href="/projects/">Projects</a> are listed separately. Descriptions of implementation and status use public code, documentation, and accessible pages. Individual contributions are stated only where supported by commit records, with fixed source revisions linked in the entries.</p>
<p>Knoweia’s name is confirmed by its public desktop package and interface. Mind Imprint’s English website uses The Mark of Thinking. AgenTerm, LivePad, and opinion dynamics are described only to the extent approved for this public page.</p>
